    "knowledge_point": "Computing the Expected Value of a Scaled Random Variable",
    "problem": "Compute $\\text{E}[3X]$ if $\\text{E}[X]=-\\frac{1}{6}.$",
    "worked_solution": "For any constant $a$ and any random variable $X,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[aX]=a\\text{E}[X].\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[3X] & =3\\text{E}[X] \\\\  & =3(-\\frac{1}{6}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
